Dataset size notes:
To create the pretrain dataset, we collected a massive dataset of 6 billion images and 35 million videos, which we then sliced ​​(using the pyscenedetect scene change detector) into 1.5 billion short scenes ranging from 2 to 60 seconds. We then filtered out samples that:

were too low-resolution: up to 256 pixels on the shortest side;

were duplicates and very similar;

were watermarked;

were overloaded with text (document photos, etc.);

were not dynamic enough.

From the remaining data, we selected 124 million scenes and 520 million images that were the most aesthetically pleasing and technically sound.

